{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白い肌がチャームポイント\nみ〜んなの お姉たま♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳まいやんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。\n19歳でした...（小声"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/0875418/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前スーパーで、さゆりんの好きな雪の宿のおせんべいがめっちゃ安かったから買おうか迷ったまいやんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日美容院に行ってきました☆サラサラ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛先を少し切ってもらって、色は若干明るくなったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーめっちゃ気持ち良かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...シャンプー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいで シャンプ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて、\n走れ！ バイシクル〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PV解禁になりましたね！\nショートボブのウィッグをみんなでかぶってます(o^^o)\n何人かはマッシュです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな同じに見えるけど、ちゃんと見つけてよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日は大阪ー！\n皆さん盛り上がって行きましょう☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしています♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問。\n扇風機派、クーラー派、それぞれでした！\n私は今年はクーラーで過ごします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪を引かないように気を付けます(￣^￣)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か質問あれば、どしどしお待ちしております(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/201